WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.002
♪♪

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.420
Gaal:
You can predict the future.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:06.757
♪♪

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:08.300
Hari:
People believe I can.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.718
♪♪

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:11.845
Hari:
And they don't like the
future I predict.

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:16.141
(Spaceship engine roaring)

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:19.144
♪♪

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:22.856
David Goyer:
Foundation is the greatest
science fiction work of all time.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.733
And it's never been brought to
the screen before.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:27.277
♪♪

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:31.114
David Goyer:
It was such a phenomenal
influence on the Star Wars Universe.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:34.576
Even things like Dune were
influenced by Foundation.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.829
Brother Day:
The might of the Imperium has
brought

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:40.457
Brother Day:
peace to thousands
of worlds.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.875
(Rockets firing)

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:42.918
(Explosions)

00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:43.919
(Gasps)

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:45.545
♪♪

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:48.674
It's a story of ideas, and they
are bold ideas.

00:00:48.674 --> 00:00:51.343
(Coin pings)

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:52.678
♪♪

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:57.099
David Goyer:
On one side you've got the
genetic dynasty, The Empire,

00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:58.850
♪♪

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:00.978
David Goyer:
on the other side there is Hari
Seldon

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:04.690
in a thousand year chess game,
in order to save a galaxy.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.857
♪♪

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:09.069
Change is frightening,
especially to those in power.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.113
♪♪

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:13.615
It's epic. It's epic in its
ambition.

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:16.994
Jared Harris:
It's epic in its storytelling,
it's a thousand year tale.

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:20.038
♪♪

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:26.420
The trick was figuring out how
to take these weighty ideas that
spanned a millennia,

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.171
David Goyer:
and make them emotional.

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:30.966
♪♪

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:33.218
I risked my life coming here.

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:34.636
♪♪

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:35.846
You made a choice.

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:38.223
♪♪

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:41.018
Lee Pace:
The story expands in such a huge
way.

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:43.729
There is so much in every
episode.

00:01:43.729 --> 00:01:46.898
Leah Harvey:
There's fighting and hatred and
love.

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:48.692
♪♪

00:01:48.692 --> 00:01:51.486
Leah Harvey:
It just speaks to the human
experience, and empathy,

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:52.487
and power.

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:54.072
♪♪

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:57.117
The size and ambition of the
show is massive.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.535
Lou Llobell:
And it's fantastic.

00:01:58.535 --> 00:01:59.536
♪♪

00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:02.748
David Goyer:
It took a while for the world to
be ready for Foundation.

00:02:03.415 --> 00:02:05.751
And that age has finally
arrived.

00:02:05.751 --> 00:02:07.127
♪♪

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.920
Hari:
You came here hoping to save
your world,

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.130
♪♪

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.757
I'm asking you to dream bigger.

00:02:11.757 --> 00:02:15.886
♪♪

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:18.138
Gaal:
Only we can shorten the
darkness.

00:02:18.138 --> 00:02:28.440
♪♪

